D79150"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017D793B0"><td data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017D79610" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/home.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017D79870" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img border="0" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2033550866/Qantas_Business_Rewards_eDM_Banner2_680x70.jpg" title="Qantas" style="width: 680px;"></font></a></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017D7A090"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017D7A2F0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 5px; height: 5px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017D7AA00"><td data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017FCD010" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img border="0" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2039397515/QF_Lounge_680x355.jpg" title="Announcement" style="width: 680px;"></font></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="main-content" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017FCDCF0" style="text-align: center; width: 600px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017FCDF50"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017FCE1B0"><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017FCE410" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: left;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017FCE8C0"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017FCEB20"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017FCF0F0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017FCF350" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 30px; height: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017FCF810"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017FCFA70" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 21px; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">We've enhanced your Qantas Business Rewards Dashboard</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001842ABF0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001842AAC0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017FD1100"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017FD1360" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Did you know that as part of your Corporate Airfares Agreement your business can access a range of benefits with Qantas Business Rewards?<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017D799A0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017FD15C0">Your business can earn points on a wide range of business expenses, use points on flights, hotels and more, and register for special promotions. That’s why we’re excited to let you know that we’ve enhanced your online dashboard to make it easier for your business to:</font><ul data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017FD1800" style="margin: 5px 0px 0px 25px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 1px;"><li data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017FD1A60" style="line-height: 20px; margin: 10px 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px 5px 0px 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">View points activity, including points earned from our 50+ program partners*</font></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017FD1DF0" style="line-height: 20px; margin: 10px 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px 5px 0px 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">View and manage any Qantas Flight Credits your business previously had as a Qantas Business Rewards member</font></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017FD2180" style="line-height: 20px; margin: 10px 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px 5px 0px 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Redeem your business’s points for flights and upgrades, directly from your Qantas Business Rewards dashboard</font></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017FD2510" style="line-height: 20px; margin: 10px 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px 5px 0px 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Manage any booking originally created through the Qantas Business Rewards portal</font></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017FD28A0" style="line-height: 20px; margin: 10px 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px 5px 0px 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Download expense reports for any transactions made through your Qantas Business Rewards account for up to 12 months from the last transaction</font></li></ul><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017FD2D60">Under your Corporate Airfares Agreement, your business has access to exclusive Qantas flight discounts which can only be booked through your Travel Agent, so your flight bookings will not appear in your Qantas Business Rewards dashboard, or on your downloaded expense reports.</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017FD3200"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017FD3460" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017FD3920"><td align="left" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017FD3B80" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; width: 285px; vertical-align: top;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><a class="two" href="https://accounts.qantas.com/qbr/identity/login?oauth-type=qbr" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017FD3DE0" style="color: rgb(228, 0, 0); border: 0